  "description": "PUWYIQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C130 H124 Dy6 Mn4 O54,10(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1A (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2A (Mn) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.266-3.740 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.94-107.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H156Dy6Mn4N10O54. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(II), Mn(III), Dy(III).",
